--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What is derived from GitNexus
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are based on GitNexus source and remain the copyright of
Abhigyan Patwari:

  packages/core        the indexing pipeline, tree-sitter language providers,
                       graph construction, search, MCP server, HTTP API and CLI
                       (upstream: gitnexus/)
  packages/shared      shared graph, schema and contract types
                       (upstream: gitnexus-shared/)
  apps/web             the Sigma.js graph dashboard
                       (upstream: gitnexus-web/)
  integrations/claude  Claude Code hooks, skills and MCP wiring
                       (upstream: gitnexus-claude-plugin/)
  integrations/cursor  Cursor hooks and skills
                       (upstream: gitnexus-cursor-integration/)
  integrations/codex   Codex hooks and MCP wiring

Modifications made in CodraGraph include renaming the project and its command
surface (`gitnexus` -> `codragraph`, `.gitnexus/` -> `.codragraph/`),
restructuring the tree into an npm workspace layout, and the additions listed
below.

